    "This device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device cannot make the proof, so one of %@ makes it. The one that does receives this wallet's viewing key, so it can read your whole history — every payment received and sent, past and future. It cannot spend. You are asked once; to keep your history to yourself, use your own prover instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device cannot make the proof, so one of %@ makes it. The one that does receives this wallet's viewing key, so it can read your whole history — every payment received and sent, past and future. It cannot spend. You are asked once; to keep your history to yourself, use your own prover instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device does not have the memory a swap needs: it makes two of the proofs itself, about 1.5 GB. Nothing was sent. Swap from the desktop app or the browser extension instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device does not have the memory a swap needs: it makes two of the proofs itself, about 1.5 GB. Nothing was sent. Swap from the desktop app or the browser extension instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device does not have the memory for this proof, and no prover is set up. Pair a prover in Settings › Prover." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device does not have the memory for this proof, and no prover is set up. Pair a prover in Settings › Prover."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device does not have the memory for this proof, so one of the %@ provers will make it. The one that does receives your viewing key and a salt inside a sealed job — never your spend key: it can read this wallet's whole history and cannot spend. This phone authorises the spend itself and checks the proof before anything is sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device does not have the memory for this proof, so one of the %@ provers will make it. The one that does receives your viewing key and a salt inside a sealed job — never your spend key: it can read this wallet's whole history and cannot spend. This phone authorises the spend itself and checks the proof before anything is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device does not have the memory for this proof, so your prover, %@, will make it. It receives your viewing key and a salt inside a sealed job — never your spend key: it can read this wallet's whole history and cannot spend. This phone authorises the spend itself and checks the proof before anything is sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device does not have the memory for this proof, so your prover, %@, will make it. It receives your viewing key and a salt inside a sealed job — never your spend key: it can read this wallet's whole history and cannot spend. This phone authorises the spend itself and checks the proof before anything is sent."
          }
        }
      }
